WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Your right hand in your left hand.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:08.820
And you're going to place it like a sword there, in your belly. Right here, just like that. To have control here over the hara.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.610
And you're going to start by breathing into your belly.

4
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.270
So I'm going to inhale, I'm going to exhale through my mouth, like this.

5
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.360
I hold my breath for 10 seconds, on the exhale.

6
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:33.475
And then, I inhale like that.

7
00:00:48.775 --> 00:00:52.075
Now, you need to practice this exercise 3 times, then 30 times.

8
00:00:53.735 --> 00:00:56.685
You'll need to increase over time. You can increase. up to

9
00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:02.021
one to two minutes without breathing.

